  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-34hy889p5p200\">查询千川投放账户账号下包含乘方计划时的聚合数据。支持指标包含消耗，点击等 </p><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1862339688407052%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1748264006369288%2C%22id%22%3A%22jtpVU%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-iowerlx59uw00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-iowerlx59uw00\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-eurzb08olnk00\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/report/all_promotion/get/<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1865675229008199\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1777555692984388\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-cs63r2p2xww00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-cs63r2p2xww00\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-jol3ls6kl3c00\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-hiwzy9usp0000\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-hiwzy9usp0000\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-fshu4fkk6bs00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-fshu4fkk6bs00\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3tldngk2690000\">千川投放账户id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">start_time</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">查询统计数据开始时间，格式：`yyyy-mm-dd`，如：2021-04-05 00:00:00</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">end_time</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">查询统计数据结束时间，格式：`yyyy-mm-dd`，如：2021-04-05 23:59:59</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">adlab_scene</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">所查询的计划类型，可选值：<br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-z2y39qgjmww00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-332iiay55wg000\"><code>OVERALL_PROJECT</code> 乘方计划</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-50erbq32uog000\"><code>UNI_PROJECT</code> 全域计划</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">data_period</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">数据周期，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-q3o7famf7sg00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-ltleitk5wsw00\"><code>ALL_DATA</code> 整体数据（默认值）</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2yj3atl591e000\"><code>OVER_ALL_DATA</code> 乘方期间数据</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4mvgc6xehs0000\"><code>UNI_DATA</code> 全域期间数据</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">marketing_goal</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">按照营销目标过滤，允许值： <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-sp757dfztcg00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-d0mjadc46jk00\"><code>ALL</code> 所有</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-49qfjslt8g8000\"><code>LIVE_PROM_GOODS</code> 直播间带货</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-fh4y1snnvw800\"><code>VIDEO_PROM_GOODS</code> 短视屏带货</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">order_platform</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">下单平台， 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-2uhg4b6css0000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2u9um0b0qko000\"><code>ALL</code> </li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4bmt5zlyu1a000\"><code>ECP_AWEME</code> </li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-167aesfo4egw00\"><code>QIANCHUAN</code> </li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">fields</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">查询指标，详见应答中data描述的返回指标</section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-8qmx7tsefg00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-8qmx7tsefg00\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv1.0%2Fqianchuan%2Freport%2Fall_promotion%2Fget%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20